flowchart TB
    A[Amplification Request] --> B{Tier 1 Authority Evidence Present?}
    B -- No --> X[Block Amplification]
    B -- Yes --> C{Tier 2 Model Evidence Replayable and Confident?}
    C -- No/Conflict --> Y[Throttle / Freeze / Review]
    C -- Yes --> D[Tier 3 Engagement Can Rank]
    D --> E{Budgets and Surface Authority Pass?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Mint Amplification Token]
    E -- No --> Z[Grant-only / Defer]
